# Backend contracts

- Resources are plural under `/api/v1/...`. IDs are UUIDs or stable slugs, never titles as PKs.
- Enums and DB columns use `snake_case`. JSON uses camelCase aliases for the frontend.
- Errors always return `{ "error": { "code", "message", "details" } }`. Do not return raw FastAPI `{ "detail": ... }` from new handlers.
- Shared schemas live in `backend/app/schemas/`. Coordinate schema edits with the day-owner (Dev1 owns catalog/connection/goal CRUD schemas).
- Routers stay thin. Business logic belongs in `backend/app/services/`.
- Do not import Nango, AstrBot, Harness, or MCP adapter clients from `backend/app/api/`.
